{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>בפתע.</b> This is אֹנֶס." "<b>פתאום.</b> This is שׁוֹגֵג. And some say: פֶּתַע and פִּתְאֹם are one thing — a sudden occurrence." "<b>וכי ימות מת עליו.</b> In the tent where he is." "<b>ביום טהרתו.</b> On the day of his sprinkling. Or is it perhaps on the eighth, when he is fully clean? Scripture says, ״on the seventh day.״ If seventh — perhaps even if he did not sprinkle? Scripture says, ״on the day of his purification״ (Sifrei)."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:09:40.535081540Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}